  "actual_call_order": [
    "RK step1 first_rk_step_part1\u2192phy_prep\u2192non-split radiation/surface/PBL/cumulus",
    "RK/scalar advances\u2192calc_p_rho_phi updates p,al (solve_em3121)",
    "moist_physics_prep_em overwrites grid%rho and prepares TH/PI/P (3822)",
    "microphysics_driver UDM27 DEN=rho (3881/2858)",
    "UDM effective-radius call uses post-microphysics T/qc/Nc and unchanged DEN (module_mp_udm476..483)",
